      "edits": [
        {
          "start": 45302,
          "previous": "Native adapters also generate Rust, .NET, native PHP and WIT/WASI packages using the same C payload mirrors. Their [source checks](../evidence/checked-record-native-hosts-20261010.md) cover conversion layouts and constructor metadata; installed-package acceptance for those four hosts remains pending. Perl and PHP-Wasm checked-record adapters remain pending. Browser execution remains pending. Nested checked records, value-dependent runtime fields, recursive checked records, other index kinds and callbacks remain unsupported. npm uses private ABI 8 for its proof-free carriers.\n",
          "current": "[Installed Rust, .NET, native PHP and WIT/WASI checks](../evidence/checked-record-remaining-hosts-20261010.md) pass the same four source/result-only routes, with two reproduced author builds, offline installation and relocated replay. Native PHP runs in weak and strict modes. These local runs use glibc 2.36 without entry-count measurements. The archive also retains the earlier PHP setup failure caused by a missing extension in the selected local PHP tool.\n\nPerl and PHP-Wasm checked-record adapters remain pending. Browser execution remains pending. Nested checked records, value-dependent runtime fields, recursive checked records, other index kinds and callbacks remain unsupported. npm uses private ABI 8 for its proof-free carriers.\n"
        },
        {
          "start": 53442,
          "previous": "| Record with erased proof fields and a checked input constructor | Node installed; browser pending | C/C++, Python, Ruby, Java and Kotlin installed; other native hosts generated, pending | Rejected | Rejected | C/C++, Python, Ruby, Java, Kotlin and Node installed; other native hosts generated, pending; browser pending; CPAN and PHP-Wasm rejected |\n",
          "current": "| Record with erased proof fields and a checked input constructor | Node installed; browser pending | C/C++, Python, Rust, Ruby, .NET, Java, Kotlin, native PHP and WIT/WASI installed | Rejected | Rejected | C/C++, Node and all eight additional native hosts installed; browser pending; CPAN and PHP-Wasm rejected |\n"
        }
      ]
    },
